{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t尖沙咀下午發生嚴重交通意外，導致1死3傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方說，死者是一名非華裔男子。另外3名傷者送院治理。警方正封鎖現場調查。<br/>\n<br/>\n現場是寶勒巷6號對開，下午近2時半，警方接報指一輛私家車懷疑剷上行人路。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:56:50.099286+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T07:33:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:57:27.986199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:50:25.729923+00:00","content_hash":"3abd8527f880920a085ee71e7ac2e1bd7fb9b07a397642629dce9e80d165ec53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}